 the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2022-07-14\u003C/desc>\n            \u003C/graphic>\n         \u003C/surface>\n        \u003Csurface type=\"right\">\n            \u003Cgraphic n=\"screen\" url=\"ISic000693_right_tiled.tif\" height=\"3680px\" width=\"5520px\">\n                \u003Cdesc>I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2022-07-14\u003C/desc>\n            \u003C/graphic>\n            \u003Cgraphic n=\"print\" url=\"ISic000693_right.jpg\" height=\"3680px\" width=\"5520px\">\n                \u003Cdesc>I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2022-07-14\u003C/desc>\n            \u003C/graphic>\n        \u003C/surface>\n    \u003C/facsimile>\n    \u003Ctext>\n        \u003Cbody>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"edition\" subtype=\"primary\" xml:space=\"preserve\" xml:lang=\"la\" resp=\"#AA #JP\" source=\"#autopsy\">\n                \u003Cab>\n                    \u003Clb n=\"1\"/>\u003CpersName type=\"attested\">\u003Cname>Tullia\u003C/name>\n                    \u003Clb n=\"2\"/>\u003Cname>Symbio\n                    \u003Clb n=\"3\" break=\"no\"/>sis\u003C/name>\u003C/persName> \u003Cexpan>\u003Cabbr>vix\u003C/abbr>\u003Cex>it\u003C/ex>\u003C/expan> \u003Cg ref=\"#ivy-leaf\">❦\u003C/g> \u003Cexpan>\u003Cabbr>ann\u003C/abbr>\u003Cex>is\u003C/ex>\u003C/expan> \u003Cg ref=\"#ivy-leaf\">❦\u003C/g>\n                    \u003Clb n=\"4\"/>\u003Cnum value=\"7\">VII\u003C/num>\n                \u003C/ab>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"apparatus\">\n                \u003ClistApp>\u003Capp>\u003Cnote>Text from autopsy\u003C/note>\u003C/app>\u003C/lis